{"id": 15331, "title": "See you there", "japanese_title": "そこで会おうね", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "see-you-there", "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/15331_see-you-there.mp3", "english_paragraphs": ["A: What time is it now?", "B: Five minutes and two points. What's wrong?", "A: I'm going to the coffee shop to meet my friends at half past two.", "B: Who are you meeting?", "A: My elementary school classmate, Lin Lin. You've seen her.", "B: I know, that girl who loves to laugh. Are you having dinner together tonight?", "A: I don’t know yet. We were just going to drink coffee and chat.", "B: After you finish drinking, come to the park next door. In the afternoon I would go to the park with a few friends to bask in the sun and play Frisbee together. Come on, too!", "A: Sounds great! How many of you are there? What time does the game start?", "B: There are five of us and we plan to meet at the gate of the park at 3:15.", "A: Great, we will come in the afternoon too. See you there or not!"], "english_full": "A: What time is it now?\n\nB: Five minutes and two points. What's wrong?\n\nA: I'm going to the coffee shop to meet my friends at half past two.\n\nB: Who are you meeting?\n\nA: My elementary school classmate, Lin Lin. You've seen her.\n\nB: I know, that girl who loves to laugh. Are you having dinner together tonight?\n\nA: I don’t know yet. We were just going to drink coffee and chat.\n\nB: After you finish drinking, come to the park next door. In the afternoon I would go to the park with a few friends to bask in the sun and play Frisbee together. Come on, too!\n\nA: Sounds great! How many of you are there? What time does the game start?\n\nB: There are five of us and we plan to meet at the gate of the park at 3:15.\n\nA: Great, we will come in the afternoon too. See you there or not!", "japanese_paragraphs": ["A：今、何時？", "B：二時五分だよ。どうしたの？", "A：二時半に友達と会うために、カフェに行くんだ。", "B：誰と会うの？", "A：小学校の同級生のリンリンだよ。君も会ったことがあるよ。", "B：ああ、よく笑うあの子ね。今夜は一緒に夕飯を食べるの？", "A：まだ分からない。コーヒーを飲みながらおしゃべりするつもりだったんだ。", "B：飲み終わったら、隣の公園に来てよ。午後は友達数人と日なたぼっこをしたり、フリスビーで遊んだりするんだ。二人もおいでよ！", "A：楽しそう！何人いるの？フリスビーは何時から？", "B：僕を入れて五人だよ。三時十五分に公園の入り口で待ち合わせる予定なんだ。", "A：いいね。じゃあ、午後は私たちも行くよ。公園で会おうね！"], "reading_paragraphs": ["えー：いま、なんじ？", "びー：にじ ごふん だよ。どうしたの？", "えー：にじはん に ともだち と あう ため に、かふぇ に いくんだ。", "びー：だれ と あうの？", "えー：しょうがっこう の どうきゅうせい の りんりん だよ。きみ も あった こと が あるよ。", "びー：ああ、よく わらう あのこ ね。こんや は いっしょ に ゆうはん を たべるの？", "えー：まだ わからない。こーひー を のみながら おしゃべり する つもり だったんだ。", "びー：のみおわったら、となり の こうえん に きてよ。ごご は ともだち すうにん と ひなたぼっこ を したり、ふりすびー で あそんだり するんだ。ふたり も おいでよ！", "えー：たのしそう！なんにん いるの？ふりすびー は なんじ から？", "びー：ぼく を いれて ごにん だよ。さんじ じゅうごふん に こうえん の いりぐち で まちあわせる よてい なんだ。", "えー：いいね。じゃあ、ごご は わたしたち も いくよ。こうえん で あおうね！"], "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ゆう\" data-defn=\"Excellent (grade)/A; superiority/excellence\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"：\" data-defn=\"： (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">：</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いま\" data-defn=\"now / at present\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">今</span><rt>いま</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"なんじ\" data-defn=\"when/at what time/how soon; normal times/ordinary days\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">何時</span><rt>なんじ</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ベル\" data-defn=\"bell; bel/B\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"：\" data-defn=\"： (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">：</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"にじ\" data-defn=\"fairly long period of time; four-hour period\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">二時</span><rt>にじ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ごぶ\" data-defn=\"half/50%/tie/evenness; 5 parts/5%\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">五分</span><rt>ごぶ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"だ\" data-defn=\"be / is (plain copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">だ</s